WEBVTT

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:03.780
Don't sit so close!

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:05.480
Stay back when you watch!

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:11.770
Huh?

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:14.470
What happened to me?

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:18.410
It's really warm...

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.250
Who... who are you?

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:26.120
Why are you crying?

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:29.460
Hey...

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:04.870
Monopoly! Grown-ups' Time!?

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:09.770
Let's eat!

00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:12.930
Here you go!

00:02:15.970 --> 00:02:19.090
Mmm! These fried eggs are pretty good!

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:21.660
The pickled vegetables are just right, too!

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:24.190
The clam and miso soup also tastes great.

00:02:24.190 --> 00:02:25.730
Ah, thank you!

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:27.670
Do we have any seaweed paste?

00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:29.940
Sorry, we just ran out

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:32.140
This is all pretty tasty!

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:34.370
Watch out for the sand in the clams, Rizel.

00:02:34.370 --> 00:02:35.780
Okay!

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:38.040
Why are you acting like you belong here?

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:39.700
Because we're her Papas!

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:45.420
Are you guys going to put up with this?!

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:46.010
Hey!
Are you guys going to put up with this?!

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:46.540
Hey!

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:50.080
You don't call your parents "you guys"! Try again!

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:52.070
That's not the issue here.

00:02:52.070 --> 00:02:55.890
No, things like this could decide our nation's future.

00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:00.730
If I don't leave now, I'm going to be late.

00:03:00.730 --> 00:03:02.800
Huh? Where are you going?

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:04.560
To school!

00:03:05.190 --> 00:03:06.800
"School"?

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:10.160
God... she's...

00:03:10.610 --> 00:03:11.820
Darling!

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:15.980
What do you want?

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:17.030
I'm going, too!

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:18.120
Going where?

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:20.410
To the place called "school"!

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:25.780
Rizel, I'll do something nice for you.
Come a little closer.

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:28.590
What is it, what is it?

00:03:28.590 --> 00:03:31.550
Well? What's this "nice thing," Darling?

00:03:31.550 --> 00:03:34.250
C'mon, Darling, tell me~!

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:39.390
You get to... mind the house!

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:43.430
Geez!

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:48.450
Ahh, Rizel-chan! That was quick!

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:49.030
That's because Darling threw me back in!
Ahh, Rizel-chan! That was quick!

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:50.850
That's because Darling threw me back in!

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:52.900
Well, that was nice of him!

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:54.470
What are you doing?

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:57.570
Laundry. Want to give it a try?

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:59.490
Yeah! It looks fun!

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:04.400
First you wash the really
dirty parts by hand, like so.

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:07.350
Hand-wash, hand-wash...!

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:14.270
Thats it! You're good, Rizel-chan!

00:04:17.180 --> 00:04:20.780
By the way, Rizel-chan,
why did you choose Tomonori?

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:21.640
Huh?

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:26.450
Darling and I are bound together by the red rope of fate!

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:29.760
I love you, Darling!

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:31.820
You're so wonderful!

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:34.330
Yes, you're bound by the red string.

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:35.530
Yes!

00:04:35.530 --> 00:04:38.050
Well, despite the way he acts,
he's a rather shy boy.

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:42.240
I hope you can understand one another and get along from now on.

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:44.030
Make sure to research his interests.

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:44.660
Okay!

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:48.430
I always wanted a cute daughter too!

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:53.900
Darling's interests?

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:55.460
That's it!

00:04:57.870 --> 00:04:59.800
Okay, pay attention!

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:00.360
This part is important!

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:01.720
Why...
This part is important!

00:05:01.720 --> 00:05:02.470
This part is important!

00:05:02.470 --> 00:05:04.680
If you can answer a question like this, the second part won't be a problem.
Why did she have to have a face like that?

00:05:04.680 --> 00:05:07.800
If you can answer a question like this, the second part won't be a problem.

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:07.810
Okay? Look at the board, and...

00:05:07.810 --> 00:05:10.400
Why did she have to have breasts like those?
Okay? Look at the board, and...

00:05:13.150 --> 00:05:16.000
Why did she have to be older than me?

00:05:16.610 --> 00:05:18.100
Why?!

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:19.370
Iwaki-kun!

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:19.910
Huh?

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:22.360
You were daydreaming, weren't you?

00:05:23.560 --> 00:05:24.540
I was not!

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:27.440
In that case, let's have you answer the previous question.

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:31.770
Sorry, but this is boring, so I'm leaving.

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:34.790
What's wrong, Iwaki-kun?

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:42.390
Darling, Darling... What do you like, Darling?

00:05:42.390 --> 00:05:44.930
Find it, find it, find the thing he likes...

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:47.390
What's this?

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:50.970
Ugh! That's awful!

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:56.820
This is that unforgettable
first smelling of the socks.

00:05:57.220 --> 00:05:58.860
Uh-oh, uh-oh...

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:02.060
If you make a mess, you have to clean it up.

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:06.520
Photograph found!

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:10.250
So, Darling likes this sort of thing?

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:12.120
Search completed!

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:14.210
Yay, yay!

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:19.360
Papa A, do you have a second?

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:23.980
Um, I'd like the things written on this list.

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:26.560
What will you be using them for?

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:29.930
I'm going to become the kind
of girl that Darling likes!

00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:32.130
Hmm... I understand.

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:35.470
I'm going to go clean up and get ready!

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:48.620
Hmm, hmm, hmm... Wait for me, Darling.

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:05.830
We can stay like this forever.

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:08.140
Darling!

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:10.240
Why are you-?

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:10.760
<i>Because I'm your wife, Darling!</i>
Why are you-?

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:13.050
<i>Because I'm your wife, Darling!</i>

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:15.170
Let's stay like this forever!

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:16.990
Cut it out!

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:20.200
I'm going to be another man's wife!
Sorry, Iwaki-kun!

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:21.610
Eh?! W-wait for me!

00:07:21.610 --> 00:07:22.230
<i>Darling!</i>
Eh?! W-wait for me!

00:07:22.230 --> 00:07:23.430
<i>Darling!</i>

00:07:23.430 --> 00:07:27.020
Darling! Darling, Darling!

00:07:30.620 --> 00:07:32.260
Just a dream...?

00:07:33.490 --> 00:07:34.710
Gah!

00:07:34.710 --> 00:07:38.070
It was getting to the best part, too!
Why'd <i>she</i>  have to show up?!

00:07:38.070 --> 00:07:39.550
She's such a nuisance...

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:42.950
Hmm, so that's your plan?

00:07:42.950 --> 00:07:44.850
Oh, how'd it go?

00:07:44.850 --> 00:07:47.740
I gave her everything I bought.

00:07:47.740 --> 00:07:50.550
She said, "I can handle it from here, so get out."

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:54.310
What in the world could she be planning to do with that stuff?

00:07:56.380 --> 00:07:57.900
I'm home!

00:08:05.020 --> 00:08:07.410
Damn it, she made a mess of my room.

00:08:07.410 --> 00:08:09.140
Darling, Darling!

00:08:09.140 --> 00:08:10.200
What?

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:12.910
I've become your ideal girl, Darling!

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:14.210
Yeah, sure you did.

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:16.890
I saw the photo you hid in that book!

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.290
Photo?!

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:21.090
Y-You saw this?!

00:08:21.090 --> 00:08:25.160
You'll be shocked and awed when you see that I'm just the way you like!

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:27.100
T-This isn't what I like...

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:27.730
Here I come!
T-This isn't what I like...

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:28.740
Here I come!

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:32.790
Ta-da!

00:08:32.790 --> 00:08:35.080
Looky looky, Darling!

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:36.330
Well?

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:39.060
W-W-W-What the hell is that outfit?!

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:42.690
Come on, this is what you like, Darling!

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:45.260
Eh? Eh...? Eh?!

00:08:50.140 --> 00:08:53.120
Ah! Are we going out somewhere, Darling?

00:08:53.940 --> 00:08:57.740
Yay, yay! I'm going out with my husband
for the first time!

00:08:57.740 --> 00:08:59.980
Please ship this as far north as you can!

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:02.190
Is this... a package?

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:05.070
It is! Anyone could tell that
it's a package, couldn't they?!

00:09:05.070 --> 00:09:05.320
Yay, yay! Package, package...
It is! Anyone could tell that
it's a package, couldn't they?!

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:05.790
Yay, yay! Package, package...

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:07.380
But it's <i>talking</i>...
Yay, yay! Package, package...

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:10.760
It's the first time I've been bundled up like luggage!
It's a talking package!
A special delivery to be sent north!

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:11.390
I'm not so sure...
It's the first time I've been bundled up like luggage!

00:09:11.390 --> 00:09:11.600
I'm not so sure...

00:09:11.600 --> 00:09:14.340
Was your "we deliver anything" slogan false advertising?!

00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:16.840
Please! Can't you just ship this
talking package out of here?!

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:20.380
W-We can do it! Behold a professional at work!

00:09:24.900 --> 00:09:26.900
I'm counting on you!

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:43.640
Huh? I wonder if I can get out through here.

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:45.440
Here we go!

00:09:49.010 --> 00:09:52.760
I'm flying, I'm flying!

00:09:59.470 --> 00:10:01.810
I'm home, Darling!

00:10:02.190 --> 00:10:05.380
W-Wh-Why are you... h-h-h-how???

00:10:05.710 --> 00:10:08.910
Hmm... well...

00:10:08.910 --> 00:10:12.240
I don't really know, but flying in the sky was fun!

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:16.710
Well believe me, it wasn't supposed to be!

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:20.980
Anyway, I have another one!
Something else you like.

00:10:20.980 --> 00:10:22.260
What?!

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:27.550
And underneath...

00:10:27.550 --> 00:10:28.130
Just kidding!

00:10:28.130 --> 00:10:32.510
Why would you think I'd go for
sailor-suit bondage and "naked apron"?!

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:40.050
Because that's what the photos in this book looked like!

00:10:40.050 --> 00:10:41.110
That book, right there?

00:10:46.260 --> 00:10:48.780
W-Why are these photos here?!

00:10:48.780 --> 00:10:51.060
Don't I look just like them?

00:10:51.590 --> 00:10:53.960
Ah, Darling!

00:10:54.360 --> 00:10:57.450
Who did it?! Who hid these in my bookcase?!

00:10:57.450 --> 00:11:01.460
Wait for me, Darling!

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:05.620
Dad?!

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:10.870
These would be printouts from magazines,
scanned and copied into photographic form.

00:11:10.870 --> 00:11:14.800
He didn't want his wife to see them,
so he hid them in Tomonori-kun's room.

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:16.760
So, you're into that sort of thing?

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:19.390
Er... well... yeah.

00:11:19.390 --> 00:11:21.940
Keep your own stash in your own room!

00:11:23.580 --> 00:11:25.900
Your stupidity knows no bounds.

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:28.010
I was wrong!
I'll throw them out right away!

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:29.710
Rizel-chan...

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:30.440
Yes?

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:33.770
Men are stupid like this.

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:38.280
But even he has <i>some</i>  good points.

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:42.950
Some types are complete idiots, through and through...

00:11:42.950 --> 00:11:45.210
...while others aren't quite so bad.

00:11:45.360 --> 00:11:46.390
Yes!

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:50.180
I wonder which type Tomonori is.

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:53.130
How would <i>I</i>  know?

00:11:53.130 --> 00:11:57.090
Still, these days it's almost too easy to find love.

00:11:57.090 --> 00:12:00.940
Indeed, it is inexcusable!
Our generation had to work for it!

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:05.850
Nowadays, they show it all off upfront, and we've lost that thrill of the hunt.

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:10.050
Sure, it's nice to see everything,
but little glances and flashes can be more enticing.

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:12.820
Quit getting worked up over pointless things!

00:12:12.820 --> 00:12:15.850
Now, now, it's all right. Let's have dinner.

00:12:15.850 --> 00:12:16.860
It looks delicious!

00:12:16.860 --> 00:12:18.660
How long are you going to wear that?

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:20.160
What? Is it bad?

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:25.600
You wearing that outfit on that body isn't enough to turn me on at all!

00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:27.000
Idiot!

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:32.840
I'm sorry! It was wrong to say that! Don't cry, Rizel!!

00:14:10.220 --> 00:14:12.270
What? I'm supposed to do it?!

00:14:12.270 --> 00:14:14.640
Iwaki Tomonori, middle school 3rd-year.
Nice to meet you.

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:16.890
Huh? What do I think of Rizel?

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:19.170
Nothing at all, except that she's a huge pain!

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:20.510
A great big nuisance!

00:14:20.510 --> 00:14:23.980
R-Rizel! Wait! Don't cry!!

00:14:27.210 --> 00:14:28.920
What? I'm supposed to do it?!

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:32.460
Ah, er... Iwaki Tomonori, middle school 3rd-year. Nice to meet you.

00:14:32.460 --> 00:14:34.570
T-The type of girl I prefer?

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:38.310
Er... well, older women, I guess.
Favorite possession? A photograph.

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:41.940
No! I mean... my bike!
That's pretty important, you know.

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:43.600
I want to get a Thunder Bike...

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:45.980
Eh? What do I think about Rizel?

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:48.180
Nothing at all, except that she's a huge pain!

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:49.710
A great big nuisance!

00:14:49.710 --> 00:14:53.580
Eh? Rizel?! W-Wait, don't cry!!
